{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It's party time again!</h2><br>Part of the new Sharp Series! Crisp visuals, better movements, and better camera angles!<br><br>Add over 350 Party themed AI visuals to AI-VJ, from across 11 different styles!<br><br>Let the good times rip!<br><br>These visuals are pre-generated for optimum performance, carefully selected and manually tweaked for artistic quality, by an experienced DJ<br><br>The visuals are recorded at 60fps, which is double the normal video framerate, to ensure smooth visuals at every BPM. The total unique runtime of all visuals together is over 40 minutes. With some duplicate plays that's standard practice in VJ sets, this package is more than enough for a two hour long DJ set<br><br>After installing the DLC you can add these visuals to your deck through the &quot;Visuals&quot; top menu, or by opening the &quot;DLC Visuals&quot; window at the top<br><br>Part of the Sharp Series!<br><br>(We're also happy to let you know that these visuals were created using green energy)","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4088960?t=1761241885","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4088960?t=1761241885","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088960/9d7e322e7672afb4ac2e3f8e33096c249ff243db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761241885","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088960/9d7e322e7672afb4ac2e3f8e33096c249ff243db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761241885","categories":[{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It's party time again!</h2><br>Part of the new Sharp Series! Crisp visuals, better movements, and better camera angles!<br><br>Add over 350 Party themed AI visuals to AI-VJ, from across 11 different styles!<br><br>Let t